@startuml State_GensolJob
!theme plain
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
}

title State Diagram: Trang thai GensolJob (ALOJ moi)

[*] --> PENDING : Admin tao job

state "PENDING" as PENDING : Job da tao\ncho Bridge nhan

state "GENERATING_INPUT" as GEN_IN : Dang chay Generator\nSinh input data\ntung test case

state "GENERATING_OUTPUT" as GEN_OUT : Dang chay Solution\nSinh expected output\ntung test case

state "UPLOADING" as UPLOAD : Dang upload\ntest cases vao\nProblemData

state "DONE" as DONE : Hoan tat\nTat ca test cases\nda duoc tao

state "ERROR" as ERROR : Loi xay ra\nGhi nhan error_message\nva error_testcase

PENDING --> GEN_IN : Bridge gui den Judge\n(gensol-request type=GEN)

GEN_IN --> GEN_IN : Moi test case:\nchay generator\nluu case_N.in
GEN_IN --> GEN_OUT : Tat ca input\nda sinh xong\n(Redis LPUSH signal)

GEN_IN --> ERROR : Generator TLE/MLE/RTE\n(gensol-stop-on-error)

GEN_OUT --> GEN_OUT : Moi test case:\nchay solution\nluu case_N.out
GEN_OUT --> UPLOAD : Tat ca output\nda sinh xong\n(Redis LPUSH signal)

GEN_OUT --> ERROR : Solution TLE/MLE/RTE

UPLOAD --> DONE : Upload thanh cong\nvao ProblemTestCase

UPLOAD --> ERROR : Loi khi upload\nhoac luu file

DONE --> [*]
ERROR --> [*]

note right of GEN_IN
  **WebSocket channel:**
  gensol_<id_secret>
  (HMAC-SHA512)

  **Redis signal:**
  LPUSH gensol_done:<id>
  BLPOP (timeout=300s)
end note

@enduml
